+From: Edoardo Pinci <epinci@outlook.com>
+Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:51:27 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH] ath79: always register ath9k GPIO descriptors
+
+OpenWrt builds ath9k as part of the separate mac80211 package, so
+CONFIG_ATH9K_AHB is not enabled in the kernel configuration. The ath79
+GPIO driver is built into the kernel and cannot see the package's Kconfig
+selection.
+
+Always register the ath9k GPIO descriptor lookup table. It is required by
+the out-of-tree ath9k module and is harmless when that module is not
+loaded.
+
+Signed-off-by: Edoardo Pinci <epinci@outlook.com>
